# Keep the build context small. Everything under target/ is excluded EXCEPT the
# locally-built static musl release binaries that the Dockerfile copies into the
# image (built by `just build-musl`). If you change the musl triple, update both
# this file and the COPY path in the Dockerfile.
target/
!target/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/release/
**/*.rs.bk
.gitignore
*.md
docs/
